IwJUApINhtJLumsH3a-p-1ZgKhcwFyUh8wgpwlRrd_Z29gJpaau-BGZDlt8TUNU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQVsKnoLekoM70OZIbRnhtnvbY11aKIIXVJOezZGrwBS1A&oe=6B106CE1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Coaster Creator VR", "keywords": ["rollercoaster", "coaster", "builder", "sandbox", "simulation"], "long_description": "**Coaster Creator VR puts a roller coaster in your hands.** Grab the track and pull it into shape around you: bank a turn, throw in a loop, then close the circuit back into the station. Shape the land, add scenery, then **shrink down to life size** and ride what you built from the front seat.\n\n**\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Build with your hands**\n- **Grab the arrows** to move, bend, bank and twist the track, with smooth, realistic curves\n- **Chain lifts, launches, brakes and friction wheels**, each with its own speed and force\n- **Supports are built for you**, automatically\n- **Sculpt the terrain** and **add scenery** around your ride\n\n**\ud83c\udfa0 Six kinds of coaster**\n\n**Steel, wooden, hanging, flying, hybrid and water**, each with its own track, train and supports. Pick **one to eight cars** and the station grows to fit.\n\n**\ud83c\udfa2 Ride it in first person**\n- **Real physics:** gravity drives the train, so your track's shape decides how fast it goes\n- **Hear every lap:** chain lifts, wheels, wind, launches and brakes\n- **Comfort vignette** for big drops\n\n**\ud83d\udccf Change your size**\n\nGrow tall to reach high track, or **shrink to 1:1 scale** and walk the station and catwalks.\n\n**\ud83d\udcbe Save your creations**\n\nSave as many coasters as you like and load them back any time.\n\n\ud83c\udf9f\ufe0f **No queue, no height requirement.** Build it, then ride it.\n\n\ud83c\udfb5 Music by **peppermint_box**.", "short_description": "Build a roller coaster around you with your own hands, then shrink down to life size and ride it in the front seat."}]}, "developer_name":